WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:06.080
You aren't rich, and it's very unlikely you ever&nbsp;
will be. The economic and power systems of this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:11.680
planet are not designed for you to get rich. The&nbsp;
"American Dream" doesn't exist. It never did.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:16.720
The writer John Steinbeck said, "socialism&nbsp;
has never taken root in America,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:22.240
because the poor see themselves as temporarily&nbsp;
embarrassed millionaires." But in reality,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:29.840
you are far more likely to become homeless than to&nbsp;
ever become a billionaire. That's just the truth.

